SUMMARY:[WS] Service Learning: Summer Refresh
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260804T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260804T120000
DTSTAMP:20260715T145058Z
UID:filoli-22055@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Filoli’s Service Learning is a chance for the local communit
 y to give back to the historic Estate. Work alongside Filoli’s Horticult
 ure Team\, weeding to prepare the ground for laying mulch\, and laying fre
 sh or augmenting existing mulch in cropped areas such as the Cutting Garde
 n\, or Vegetable Garden.\n\nTickets: Free\; reservation required.\n\nParti
 cipants receive free admission to Filoli on the day of the program.\n\nAge
 s: All ages\nSource: https://filoli.org/event/service-learning-summer-refr
 esh/2026-08-04/\nLast synced: 2026-07-15 07:50 PDT
LOCATION:Filoli Historic House & Garden\, 86 Cañada Road\, Woodside
URL:https://filoli.org/event/service-learning-summer-refresh/2026-08-04/
END:VEVENT
